│                         CONTROLLER STARTUP                                      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                      │
                                      ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  main()                                                                         │
│  ├── getKubeClient()            → Connect to K8s API                            │
│  ├── purger.NewPurger()         → Create pod deletion handler                   │
│  ├── reconciler.NewReconciler() → Create score watcher                          │
│  ├── go configRefreshLoop()     → Fetch config from API every 60s               │
│  └── go reconcileLoop()         → Main loop every 10s                           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                      │
                                      ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  reconcileLoop() - Every 10 seconds                                             │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  1. Check if auto-purge enabled                                                 │
│  2. GET /api/pods → Fetch all pod scores from API                               │
│  3. For each pod:                                                               │
│     ├── IF score < threshold → Add to pendingPurges with grace period           │
│     └── IF score recovered   → Remove from pendingPurges (cancel purge)         │
│  4. Process pending purges past grace period:                                   │
│     ├── Re-check current score                                                  │
│     ├── If still below threshold → purger.PurgePod()                            │
│     └── K8s auto-recreates pod from Deployment (fresh start, score=100)         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Purge Speed Settings:
┌─────────────────┬─────────────┬──────────────┬────────────────────────────┐
│  Speed          │  Threshold  │  Grace Period │  Behavior                 │
├─────────────────┼─────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────┤
│  off            │     -       │      -       │  No auto-purge             │
│  conservative   │    < 30     │    300s      │  Wait 5 min, then purge    │
│  moderate       │    < 40     │     60s      │  Wait 1 min, then purge    │
│  aggressive     │    < 50     │      0s      │  Immediate purge           │
└─────────────────┴─────────────┴──────────────┴────────────────────────────┘

Purge Flow Example:
Config: moderate (threshold=40, grace=60s)

T+0s:   Reconcile detects nginx-abc score=35 < 40
        → Add to pendingPurges, will purge at T+60s
        → Log: "⚠️ Pod nginx-abc score 35 < 40, scheduled for purge in 60s"

T+30s:  SCENARIO A - Score Recovers:
        → nginx-abc score=45 (recovered!)
        → Remove from pendingPurges
        → Log: "✅ Pod nginx-abc score recovered (35 → 45), canceling purge"

T+60s:  SCENARIO B - No Recovery:
        → Re-check score: still 35
        → purger.PurgePod()
           ├── Record K8s Event for audit
           └── kubectl delete pod nginx-abc --grace-period=0
        → Log: "🗑️ Purged pod nginx-abc (score: 35)"
        → Deployment recreates pod → New pod starts fresh with score=100
        
        
